WEBVTT

01:26.480 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.520 --> 01:32.900
[Episode 26]

01:54.990 --> 01:56.460
My Lord, I have failed you.

01:56.680 --> 01:58.479
I fell into Rong Shanbao's trap.

01:58.640 --> 01:59.590
My Lord, please rest assured.

01:59.590 --> 02:00.070
I will definitely

02:00.070 --> 02:00.970
deal with Yang Yitang.

02:00.970 --> 02:02.230
I absolutely will not allow him

02:02.230 --> 02:03.170
to stand in your way.

02:03.170 --> 02:04.770
You have served me for years.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.860
I've treated you well, haven't I?

02:08.000 --> 02:08.520
Yes.

02:08.910 --> 02:09.430
Yes.

02:19.320 --> 02:21.250
Do you understand what I'm saying?

02:25.910 --> 02:26.710
I understand.

02:27.120 --> 02:27.920
I understand.

02:28.340 --> 02:29.140
I understand.

02:36.329 --> 02:39.310
[Linji Prefectural Office]

02:38.000 --> 02:39.370
I was blinded

02:40.030 --> 02:41.070
by greed

02:42.290 --> 02:43.240
and took Yang Yitang's bribes

02:43.240 --> 02:44.700
behind Lord Jiang's back.

02:45.450 --> 02:48.060
It is well-known that Yang Yitang
holds deep resentment

02:48.060 --> 02:49.460
against the Rong family.

02:49.760 --> 02:51.829
The Rong family is wealthy enough
to rival a nation.

02:51.829 --> 02:53.400
I also wanted a share of that fortune.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.400
Therefore, I secretly assisted him

02:54.400 --> 02:56.410
in seeking revenge
against the Rong family.

02:56.410 --> 02:58.220
Now that my crimes have been exposed,

02:58.220 --> 03:00.150
I have nothing to say in my defense.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.740
So you are claiming

03:02.400 --> 03:05.060
that Lord Jiang
was completely unaware of this?

03:06.410 --> 03:07.210
That's right.

03:08.060 --> 03:09.690
The bribes I accepted from Yang Yitang

03:09.690 --> 03:11.220
are hidden in my residence.

03:11.460 --> 03:13.090
You'll find them if you search my place.

03:13.090 --> 03:15.020
For an official to neglect his duty

03:15.570 --> 03:17.430
is to betray the Emperor's grace.

03:17.900 --> 03:19.630
I know my crimes deserve death,

03:20.340 --> 03:22.300
and I dare not implicate others.

03:22.940 --> 03:25.130
I only ask for

03:25.570 --> 03:27.170
some dignity after my death.

03:41.650 --> 03:42.850
You don't seem surprised

03:42.850 --> 03:44.310
by Zhang Zhong's suicide.

03:44.410 --> 03:46.370
Jiang Yiqian has served
as an official for 30 years.

03:46.370 --> 03:47.130
If he couldn't handle

03:47.130 --> 03:48.390
such a trivial matter,

03:48.570 --> 03:50.350
then his 30 years of service
would mean nothing.

03:50.350 --> 03:51.900
He understands
how the bureaucratic game works

03:51.900 --> 03:53.500
and how his superiors think.

03:54.130 --> 03:55.790
Even if he's under suspicion,

03:55.900 --> 03:58.100
that alone isn't enough to convict him.

03:58.440 --> 03:59.840
You allowed him to meddle

03:59.850 --> 04:00.980
in the Rong Mansion.

04:01.460 --> 04:03.060
Wasn't that all for nothing?

04:03.570 --> 04:04.780
I allowed his meddling

04:04.780 --> 04:06.240
because I had other plans.

04:06.300 --> 04:07.260
I also used him

04:07.570 --> 04:09.460
to purge the traitors
within the Rong family.

04:09.460 --> 04:10.710
Yang Yitang has confessed

04:10.710 --> 04:12.240
to conspiring with Yunshu.

04:12.460 --> 04:14.690
Since this matter concerns your family,

04:14.690 --> 04:16.060
do you wish to handle it yourself,

04:16.060 --> 04:18.350
or should I intervene and make the arrest?

04:18.350 --> 04:19.550
But I must remind you—

04:19.790 --> 04:21.720
the current manager of the Rong family

04:21.720 --> 04:22.400
is her.

04:23.300 --> 04:24.230
There is no rush.

04:24.690 --> 04:25.950
She'll invite me back.

04:27.450 --> 04:29.210
Now that Jiang Yiqian
has revealed his true nature,

04:29.210 --> 04:30.420
I'm afraid

04:30.420 --> 04:32.330
he’ll be even more ruthless
in seeking revenge.

04:32.330 --> 04:34.010
You must be extremely cautious.

04:34.010 --> 04:36.210
If things get out of hand, come find me.

04:36.770 --> 04:37.860
Right now, Jiang Yiqian probably

04:37.860 --> 04:39.920
wants you dead more than anyone else.

04:40.500 --> 04:42.100
I'm just collateral damage,

04:42.630 --> 04:44.630
caught in the fight between you two.

04:44.890 --> 04:46.420
Since I've implicated you,

04:46.690 --> 04:47.740
why not punish me

04:48.250 --> 04:50.310
by keeping me as your personal guard?

04:52.330 --> 04:53.100
Lord Lu,

04:54.020 --> 04:55.740
you should now turn your attention

04:55.740 --> 04:57.000
to the Wei family case.

04:58.659 --> 04:59.370
Although the truth

04:59.370 --> 05:01.290
of the Wei family case has come to light,

05:01.290 --> 05:02.770
there are still some inconsistencies.

05:02.770 --> 05:03.250
First,

05:03.940 --> 05:05.740
if Jiang Yiqian didn't take bribes,

05:05.740 --> 05:07.370
why would he help the Yang family

05:07.370 --> 05:09.300
frame Wei Kejian
for the murder of his wife?

05:09.300 --> 05:11.180
Second, who is

05:11.570 --> 05:12.370
still harassing

05:12.370 --> 05:14.340
Madam Yang even after she's become a nun?

05:14.340 --> 05:16.180
If you think about it,

05:16.180 --> 05:18.380
both matters lead back to Jiang Yiqian.

05:18.550 --> 05:21.410
Rest assured,
I'll surely get to the bottom of this.

05:21.420 --> 05:24.020
The fox's tail will be exposed
sooner or later.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.740
Thank you, Lord Luo,
for uncovering the truth

05:30.740 --> 05:31.940
and clearing my name.

05:33.180 --> 05:34.510
A toast to you, Lord Luo.

05:41.560 --> 05:42.240
Well,

05:42.260 --> 05:44.260
it was simply my duty as an official.

05:44.930 --> 05:47.510
You've been stationed
in Linji for decades, Lord Jiang.

05:47.510 --> 05:49.170
Your truly put a lot of effort.

05:49.890 --> 05:52.570
But you should stay humble and cautious

05:53.180 --> 05:54.440
to secure your future.

05:55.930 --> 05:57.690
Thank you for your advice, Lord Luo.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.690
I will surely keep it firmly in mind.

06:01.890 --> 06:04.710
With the Yang Yitang
and Zhang Zhong cases resolved,

06:04.710 --> 06:05.840
Lord Luo, this time,

06:06.060 --> 06:07.860
you've solved another case

06:08.180 --> 06:09.620
during the Empress Dowager's
birthday celebration.

06:09.620 --> 06:12.130
Truly, it's the most capable people
who do the most work.

06:12.130 --> 06:13.190
Speaking of which,

06:14.100 --> 06:16.710
the Rong family's
hundred-year-old Tea King Tree

06:16.710 --> 06:18.510
is truly a wonder of nature.

06:18.750 --> 06:20.550
It's absolutely breathtaking.

06:21.370 --> 06:22.250
But...

06:23.620 --> 06:24.300
What is it?

06:26.420 --> 06:27.330
Forgive me,

06:28.180 --> 06:31.250
but the Rong family has recently
suffered a series of misfortunes.

06:31.250 --> 06:32.710
You should keep a close eye

06:32.980 --> 06:35.330
over the birthday tribute, Lord Luo.

06:36.010 --> 06:37.770
You cleared my name,

06:37.960 --> 06:40.050
so my warning is out of goodwill.

06:40.750 --> 06:43.330
The Rong family has long
held grudge against me.

06:43.330 --> 06:45.240
I'm worried they may stir up trouble

06:45.240 --> 06:46.770
over the birthday tribute,

06:47.230 --> 06:49.060
since they're unhappy with your verdict.

06:49.060 --> 06:50.659
You could be charged

06:50.659 --> 06:52.120
with dereliction of duty.

06:52.400 --> 06:54.060
Linji is a complex territory.

06:54.500 --> 06:55.770
I'm sure you'd prefer

06:55.890 --> 06:57.350
to settle things quickly,

06:57.830 --> 06:59.960
before they become more complicated.

07:02.860 --> 07:05.740
That's a fair point.

07:08.330 --> 07:08.740
Come.

07:09.500 --> 07:10.300
A toast to you.

07:27.500 --> 07:28.660
How's your health?

07:42.260 --> 07:42.790
Here.

07:42.930 --> 07:44.460
The drowned victim is here.

07:55.890 --> 07:56.690
Take him away.

07:58.940 --> 08:01.070
Have a drink first to warm yourself up.

08:07.140 --> 08:10.270
Thank you, My Lord,
for giving me a second chance at life.

08:13.250 --> 08:13.910
Please sit.

08:16.450 --> 08:17.690
As you instructed,

08:18.060 --> 08:20.400
I've warned Lord Luo
about the birthday tribute.

08:20.400 --> 08:22.060
Do you really want to stay here

08:22.510 --> 08:24.170
and not return to the capital?

08:24.420 --> 08:25.370
But I've heard

08:25.580 --> 08:26.900
that you and Lady Rong Yunshu

08:26.900 --> 08:27.960
are still engaged.

08:28.850 --> 08:30.690
Once I settle this old grievance,

08:30.690 --> 08:31.950
I'll leave this place.

08:32.630 --> 08:34.210
I treated her with sincerity,

08:34.210 --> 08:36.240
yet she discarded me like a worn shoe.

08:36.240 --> 08:36.900
Therefore,

08:37.760 --> 08:39.419
I will no longer lower myself.

08:39.750 --> 08:41.210
I will make her understand

08:41.549 --> 08:43.000
that I am not someone

08:43.460 --> 08:45.140
she can toy with.

08:45.700 --> 08:46.220
Good.

08:47.350 --> 08:48.810
That's how a man should be.

08:49.610 --> 08:52.210
So, what's your next move?

08:53.200 --> 08:56.040
The daughters of the Rong family
appear united but are divided within.

08:56.040 --> 08:58.700
We can first observe
their internal conflicts.

08:59.520 --> 09:00.790
When the time is right,

09:01.450 --> 09:03.370
we'll cut off the foundation
of the Rong family.

09:03.370 --> 09:03.970
By then,

09:05.490 --> 09:06.780
if you wish to take over

09:06.780 --> 09:07.710
the Rong family,

09:07.970 --> 09:09.230
it will be effortless.

09:11.040 --> 09:13.840
Mr. Bai, you are truly
a man of exceptional talent.

09:14.040 --> 09:16.440
I believe that once you enter officialdom,

09:16.450 --> 09:18.450
you will certainly reach the peak.

09:21.570 --> 09:22.020
Come.

09:31.350 --> 09:32.820
I miss Father.

09:36.190 --> 09:36.910
Li.

09:38.170 --> 09:38.810
Look.

09:39.900 --> 09:41.560
Look at these vast tea fields.

09:41.940 --> 09:42.920
One day,

09:43.420 --> 09:45.220
you will have your share as well.

09:47.210 --> 09:48.340
You're a bad person.

09:48.970 --> 09:50.450
I don't want to play with you anymore.

09:50.450 --> 09:52.180
I want to find Father.

09:53.020 --> 09:54.210
Li! Li!

09:55.260 --> 09:56.090
Li, come back!

10:23.960 --> 10:24.430
Yun...

10:29.260 --> 10:29.920
Lady Yunxi.

10:30.850 --> 10:31.780
Why are you here?

10:32.610 --> 10:33.730
Didn’t I tell you

10:33.730 --> 10:35.930
not to come near the Rong Mansion again?

10:37.310 --> 10:38.910
I prepared some mulian tofu.

10:38.970 --> 10:41.250
I remember it's your favorite.

10:42.420 --> 10:43.020
And Li,

10:43.580 --> 10:44.700
she likes it too.

10:58.420 --> 11:00.220
The Rong Mansion lacks nothing.

11:00.470 --> 11:02.000
If you dare come here again,

11:02.100 --> 11:03.500
I'll have you thrown out.

11:05.380 --> 11:06.040
Lady Yunxi.

11:08.420 --> 11:10.780
How is Li doing?

11:12.660 --> 11:14.210
Does she still need

11:14.210 --> 11:15.330
to hold someone's ear

11:15.330 --> 11:16.860
before she can fall asleep?

11:17.260 --> 11:18.660
Has she been eating well?

11:19.340 --> 11:21.040
She used to have such a sweet tooth.

11:21.040 --> 11:22.690
Every time I tried to feed her,

11:22.690 --> 11:25.090
I had to chase her
all around the courtyard.

11:25.570 --> 11:26.770
Has she grown taller?

11:28.140 --> 11:28.800
Does she...

11:30.970 --> 11:31.850
miss me?

11:37.870 --> 11:38.530
Lady Yunxi.

11:40.930 --> 11:42.590
May I just see her for a moment?

11:43.180 --> 11:44.910
I won't say a single word to her.

11:45.180 --> 11:47.110
A glimpse from afar will be enough.

11:49.830 --> 11:50.830
I miss her so much.

12:01.430 --> 12:02.030
An Cha,

12:02.850 --> 12:04.090
when you allowed Rong Shanbao

12:04.090 --> 12:04.970
to take Li away,

12:05.800 --> 12:07.160
you gave up on Li,

12:07.730 --> 12:08.860
and you gave up on me.

12:09.610 --> 12:10.610
Grandmother has no patience

12:10.610 --> 12:12.270
for those who refuse to let go.

12:12.450 --> 12:14.560
If you truly care for Li's well-being,

12:14.560 --> 12:16.420
then stay out of her life forever.

12:17.350 --> 12:18.490
Don't give people a reason

12:18.490 --> 12:19.420
to laugh at her.

13:12.540 --> 13:13.140
Miss,

13:13.660 --> 13:15.110
The method of harvesting the Tea King Tree

13:15.110 --> 13:16.420
is a family secret,
known only to the Rong family heads

13:16.420 --> 13:18.020
and passed down
from generation to generation.

13:18.020 --> 13:19.180
In the past, Lady Shanbao

13:19.180 --> 13:20.730
was the only one who took care of it.

13:20.730 --> 13:22.590
The roasting method that follows

13:22.610 --> 13:24.010
is also known only to her.

13:24.940 --> 13:26.800
With the Old Madam now bedridden,

13:27.140 --> 13:28.610
I'm afraid she is indispensable

13:28.610 --> 13:30.070
to this imperial tribute.

13:31.690 --> 13:33.290
The heads of the Rong family.

13:33.780 --> 13:34.420
Very well.

13:35.210 --> 13:36.740
Then go and invite her back.

13:37.780 --> 13:39.580
Station guards at Chongxi Hall.

13:39.850 --> 13:41.570
For Grandmother's well-being,

13:41.570 --> 13:42.810
no one is allowed to visit her

13:42.810 --> 13:44.020
except me.

14:00.850 --> 14:02.110
If you're not careful,

14:02.420 --> 14:03.610
the final result will be

14:03.610 --> 14:04.940
the leaves falling off.

14:11.450 --> 14:12.710
How dare you come here?

14:14.520 --> 14:16.070
That outfit suits you well.

14:16.350 --> 14:16.780
You!

14:30.690 --> 14:31.490
Yesterday, Lord Luo

14:31.490 --> 14:33.450
sent people to ask about the tribute.

14:33.450 --> 14:34.780
Only Shanbao knows

14:34.780 --> 14:36.020
how to harvest the Tea King Tree,

14:36.020 --> 14:37.210
which is why I came

14:37.210 --> 14:38.340
to ask you to return.

14:40.610 --> 14:42.660
So you came to ask for help.

14:43.420 --> 14:44.940
Presenting a tribute
to the Empress Dowager

14:44.940 --> 14:47.330
concerns the future
of the entire Rong family.

14:47.330 --> 14:48.380
Previously,

14:48.690 --> 14:51.150
Grandmother expelled you
from the mansion,

14:51.310 --> 14:52.790
but she is now ill.

14:53.420 --> 14:54.680
So I'm making the decision in her stead

14:54.680 --> 14:55.900
to bring you back home.

14:55.900 --> 14:58.230
I hope you'll think of the bigger picture.

14:59.910 --> 15:02.020
Since Yunshu is willing to compromise,

15:02.020 --> 15:03.550
I shall graciously accept.

15:03.900 --> 15:04.900
I wonder, Yunshu—

15:05.490 --> 15:06.950
have you found Mr. Bai yet?

15:09.140 --> 15:11.070
You don't need to worry about that.

15:13.970 --> 15:16.030
I'll leave the tea plantation to you.

15:16.810 --> 15:17.660
Please take care

15:17.660 --> 15:18.740
of Yunyin and Wanwan.

15:18.740 --> 15:19.540
Rest assured.

15:20.630 --> 15:22.630
I don't need anyone to look after me.

15:22.850 --> 15:23.570
As for you,

15:24.300 --> 15:25.630
you must stay cautious.

15:26.030 --> 15:27.890
You've already been fooled once.

15:28.310 --> 15:29.470
Beware those

15:29.490 --> 15:31.890
who appear kind
but have a serpent's heart.

16:03.850 --> 16:05.380
All of the Wei family's seized assets

16:05.380 --> 16:06.510
have been returned.

16:06.730 --> 16:07.690
Now it's the Wei family members

16:07.690 --> 16:09.020
who are taking care of him.

16:09.020 --> 16:11.350
They've consulted
countless doctors lately,

16:11.350 --> 16:14.080
yet his mental condition
hasn't improved at all.

16:15.090 --> 16:16.220
Do you know Yang Yun?

16:18.300 --> 16:19.590
No matter what you ask, My Lord,

16:19.590 --> 16:21.650
I'm afraid he won't be able to answer.

16:31.360 --> 16:33.470
What did Jiang Yiqian do to you?

16:43.760 --> 16:46.020
Wei has been mentally unstable for years.

16:46.020 --> 16:46.820
As you can see,

16:47.300 --> 16:48.330
he doesn't respond

16:48.330 --> 16:49.610
to any external stimuli.

16:49.610 --> 16:50.380
But the moment he heard

16:50.380 --> 16:51.850
the name "Jiang Yiqian,"

16:53.170 --> 16:54.660
he showed a look of terror.

16:56.120 --> 16:57.040
I suspect

16:58.180 --> 17:00.260
there might be a deeper secret
in Wei's old case.

17:00.260 --> 17:02.300
I'll interview
Wei's family members right now

17:02.300 --> 17:03.900
to see if I can find any clues.

17:10.490 --> 17:12.690
Has Bai Yingsheng still not been found?

17:14.140 --> 17:14.770
Not yet.

17:15.319 --> 17:16.050
I've already instructed my men

17:16.050 --> 17:17.450
to continue searching downstream.

17:17.450 --> 17:18.390
As soon as I hear anything,

17:18.390 --> 17:20.650
I'll report to you immediately, My Lord.

17:21.819 --> 17:24.140
My Lord, I also heard

17:24.530 --> 17:27.660
that Lady Rong Shanbao
has returned to the Rong Mansion.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.370
During your absence, Shanbao,

17:36.940 --> 17:39.270
did I take proper care
of the Tea King Tree?

17:40.620 --> 17:41.080
Not bad.

17:42.000 --> 17:43.940
Grandmother is bedridden
with a serious illness.

17:43.940 --> 17:45.210
For this imperial tribute,

17:45.210 --> 17:47.210
we'll have to count on you, Shanbao.

17:47.940 --> 17:49.470
But rest assured, Shanbao.

17:49.940 --> 17:51.470
I'll stay right by your side

17:51.770 --> 17:53.770
until the tea roasting is finished.

17:53.770 --> 17:55.370
You want to learn the method?

17:55.960 --> 17:57.290
Have you forgotten that

17:57.770 --> 17:59.250
the tea-making method

17:59.250 --> 18:01.010
belongs exclusively
to the heads of the family,

18:01.010 --> 18:02.530
and cannot be shared with outsiders?

18:02.530 --> 18:03.140
Shanbao,

18:03.580 --> 18:05.510
I am now the Rong family's manager.

18:05.730 --> 18:07.330
Why can't you pass it on to me?

18:07.860 --> 18:09.010
Have you asked Grandmother about this?

18:09.010 --> 18:09.940
As I said,

18:10.450 --> 18:12.380
I am now the Rong family's manager.

18:13.080 --> 18:15.340
Why is that so hard for you to understand?

18:16.940 --> 18:17.800
What will you do

18:19.010 --> 18:19.730
if I refuse?

18:20.420 --> 18:21.010
Shanbao,

18:21.660 --> 18:23.820
the moment you stepped back
into the Rong Mansion,

18:23.820 --> 18:25.480
you lost your right to choose.

18:25.970 --> 18:27.730
If anything goes wrong with the tribute,

18:27.730 --> 18:29.390
you alone will bear the blame.

18:30.050 --> 18:31.450
After all, everyone saw

18:31.730 --> 18:33.790
that I personally welcomed you back.

18:39.150 --> 18:39.740
Shanbao,

18:40.180 --> 18:41.780
you should think carefully.

18:41.940 --> 18:42.620
Will you choose

18:42.620 --> 18:44.550
to teach me the tea-making methods

18:44.730 --> 18:46.290
or delay the tribute

18:46.420 --> 18:47.680
and be arrested for it?

18:50.340 --> 18:51.740
You're competing with me

18:52.100 --> 18:53.770
for control of the Rong family.

18:53.770 --> 18:55.180
If the family falls, we all fall.

18:55.180 --> 18:56.210
If the tribute is delayed,

18:56.210 --> 18:57.820
the entire Rong family will suffer.

18:57.820 --> 18:58.730
Even if you win,

18:59.210 --> 19:01.270
what benefits would you gain from it?

19:01.970 --> 19:04.300
The one who cares more
is the one who loses.

19:05.650 --> 19:07.420
Shanbao, I know

19:07.690 --> 19:09.890
you value the Rong family more than I do.

19:35.290 --> 19:35.970
Miss Shen.

19:36.860 --> 19:39.140
Lady Yunxi said Li is here.

19:39.770 --> 19:41.500
Please, Miss Shen, do me a favor

19:42.020 --> 19:43.370
and allow me to say a few words to her.

19:43.370 --> 19:44.500
I want this one.

19:44.940 --> 19:45.600
Here you go.

19:46.530 --> 19:47.940
She's playing over there.

19:47.940 --> 19:48.960
This one is pretty too.

19:48.960 --> 19:49.680
Wanwan.

19:53.010 --> 19:54.210
Xiangling.

19:55.020 --> 19:56.420
Father.

19:58.730 --> 19:59.930
Thank you, Miss Shen.

20:04.900 --> 20:05.730
Father.

20:05.730 --> 20:06.290
Li.

20:07.830 --> 20:08.460
Li.

20:15.610 --> 20:17.970
Li, I miss you so much.

20:18.500 --> 20:19.600
Do you miss me?

20:19.860 --> 20:20.450
Yes.

20:24.000 --> 20:25.530
Yunxi must have been blind.

20:25.690 --> 20:26.860
How could she fall

20:26.860 --> 20:28.140
for such a weak man?

20:28.400 --> 20:29.600
Keep your voice down!

20:32.140 --> 20:33.740
Let's pick a bit of this, too.

20:37.530 --> 20:38.210
Wanwan.

20:39.860 --> 20:41.320
Is the tea tree a toy to you?

20:41.620 --> 20:42.480
Don't touch it!

20:43.950 --> 20:44.360
No!

20:45.180 --> 20:46.110
Stop it, you two.

20:46.450 --> 20:48.140
Why are you arguing with a kid?

20:48.140 --> 20:48.740
Come here!

20:48.900 --> 20:49.730
Be careful.

20:50.940 --> 20:52.100
You can't catch me.

20:52.540 --> 20:54.140
Sit down and have some water.

20:56.290 --> 20:56.920
Li,

20:57.420 --> 20:59.020
I want to take you somewhere.

21:00.090 --> 21:00.690
Come here.

21:01.520 --> 21:02.100
Are you coming or not?

21:02.100 --> 21:02.690
No!

21:03.530 --> 21:04.330
Rong Yunyin.

21:05.180 --> 21:06.420
Don't go too far.

21:06.690 --> 21:07.900
You can't catch me!

21:07.900 --> 21:08.500
Come here.

21:09.420 --> 21:10.020
Come here!

21:25.580 --> 21:26.380
Lady Shanbao.

21:31.290 --> 21:32.050
Lady Shanbao.

21:32.050 --> 21:33.180
We're here on Lady Yunshu's orders

21:33.180 --> 21:34.780
to secure Hualin Courtyard.

21:39.660 --> 21:42.050
Lady Yunshu personally
welcomed Lady Shanbao back home.

21:42.050 --> 21:42.620
There is no justification

21:42.620 --> 21:44.620
for keeping her confined like this!

21:44.820 --> 21:47.150
Yunshu won't allow me to see Grandmother.

21:47.250 --> 21:48.310
Mr. Yan, do you know

21:48.660 --> 21:50.120
how Grandmother is doing?

21:51.400 --> 21:52.060
Lady Yunshu

21:52.070 --> 21:54.380
hasn't actually stopped me from visiting.

21:54.380 --> 21:54.940
Every two days or so,

21:54.940 --> 21:56.540
I pay a visit to Chongxi Hall.

21:56.860 --> 21:57.860
Old Madam Rong...

21:58.490 --> 22:00.490
she is still unable to get out of bed,

22:00.580 --> 22:01.140
but she's speaking

22:01.140 --> 22:02.400
much more clearly now.

22:03.300 --> 22:05.050
While you were away from the Rong Mansion,

22:05.050 --> 22:05.690
I made sure

22:05.690 --> 22:07.620
to take good care of Old Madam Rong.

22:08.830 --> 22:09.430
Thank you.

22:11.730 --> 22:12.530
Lady Shanbao.

22:17.140 --> 22:17.620
If...

22:19.900 --> 22:21.230
you ever need my help...

22:21.610 --> 22:22.370
No need.

22:38.630 --> 22:40.530
Xiu Qiong, you may leave now.

22:49.050 --> 22:50.180
You can come out now.

23:05.240 --> 23:07.500
How did you know I was here, Lady Shanbao?

23:07.730 --> 23:09.330
Sneaking into my courtyard—

23:09.380 --> 23:11.410
you've grown increasingly rude lately.

23:11.410 --> 23:13.160
I came to pay a formal visit,

23:13.770 --> 23:14.660
but your servant

23:14.660 --> 23:15.460
drove me away.

23:15.820 --> 23:18.010
The more I thought about it,
the more uneasy I felt.

23:18.010 --> 23:19.340
I was worried about you,

23:19.530 --> 23:20.530
so I slipped in.

23:21.820 --> 23:22.290
I intended to leave

23:22.290 --> 23:23.690
once I knew you were safe.

23:24.210 --> 23:25.540
But you caught me first.

23:27.860 --> 23:28.460
By the way,

23:29.290 --> 23:30.490
where is your

23:30.490 --> 23:31.350
Steward Cheng?

23:31.730 --> 23:33.150
Whenever he hears that I'm here,

23:33.150 --> 23:35.480
he's always the first one
to chase me away.

23:37.770 --> 23:38.450
These days,

23:39.530 --> 23:41.460
has Jiang Yiqian tried to harm you?

23:42.820 --> 23:44.220
You're worried about me?

23:45.140 --> 23:45.740
Xiu Qiong.

23:45.800 --> 23:46.310
Wait.

23:48.210 --> 23:50.250
Jiang Yiqian has been very quiet lately.

23:50.250 --> 23:51.410
I deliberately made a show

23:51.410 --> 23:52.560
of summoning the Wei family members,

23:52.560 --> 23:54.360
but he hasn't made a single move.

23:55.400 --> 23:57.830
There's something I need your help with.

24:01.900 --> 24:03.030
Why are you smiling?

24:08.860 --> 24:11.720
Because you're actually willing
to ask for my help.

24:13.340 --> 24:14.070
That's nice.

24:17.940 --> 24:20.600
You were eavesdropping
on my conversation with Mr. Yan.

24:20.600 --> 24:22.460
I overheard it unintentionally.

24:23.940 --> 24:24.860
You said

24:24.940 --> 24:26.870
you needed my help with something?

24:27.420 --> 24:28.380
I'd like to see

24:28.620 --> 24:30.580
the inventory list
of the Wei family's seized assets,

24:30.580 --> 24:31.670
and the list of items

24:31.670 --> 24:32.870
that were returned

24:33.220 --> 24:34.680
after the case was closed.

24:36.050 --> 24:36.650
All right.

24:36.970 --> 24:38.870
I'll go to the office
and retrieve them for you.

24:38.870 --> 24:39.940
But Yunshu

24:39.940 --> 24:41.050
has confined you to the Rong Mansion

24:41.050 --> 24:42.210
and won't allow you to see anyone.

24:42.210 --> 24:43.820
Since you won't let me
sneak into your courtyard,

24:43.820 --> 24:45.080
once I get the records,

24:45.100 --> 24:47.300
how am I supposed to deliver them to you?

24:47.860 --> 24:48.790
It won't be long.

24:53.620 --> 24:54.620
Reading a book?

24:57.380 --> 24:59.380
Dear, listen to this.

24:59.490 --> 25:00.820
Do you want to hold this?

25:01.010 --> 25:01.450
Yes.

25:01.770 --> 25:03.180
Good. I'll put it here.

25:04.900 --> 25:05.660
Is it fun?

25:06.180 --> 25:06.980
Yes, it's fun.

25:07.690 --> 25:08.290
You see,

25:09.380 --> 25:10.900
Lord Jiang is also very fond of children.

25:10.900 --> 25:12.100
Would you like to try this?

25:12.100 --> 25:12.940
You will be

25:13.530 --> 25:14.450
very safe here.

25:15.290 --> 25:16.690
No one can

25:16.900 --> 25:18.100
take Li away from you.

25:19.450 --> 25:20.510
Why did you help me?

25:21.290 --> 25:24.090
The women of the Rong family
are mostly heartless.

25:24.730 --> 25:26.530
Since we've both been betrayed,

25:26.530 --> 25:27.250
helping you

25:28.820 --> 25:30.880
is no different from helping myself.

25:33.140 --> 25:33.860
Lady Yunxi is not

25:33.860 --> 25:34.990
a heartless person.

25:36.450 --> 25:38.310
It's just that I acted on impulse.

25:38.340 --> 25:39.470
Only now do I realize

25:40.010 --> 25:41.340
that I can't let go of Li,

25:41.900 --> 25:43.630
and I can't let go of her either.

25:45.860 --> 25:47.390
Eat slowly, take your time.

25:53.860 --> 25:55.860
An Cha is
Li's biological father, after all.

25:55.860 --> 25:57.660
He seemed so gentle and harmless,

25:57.660 --> 25:59.490
and he claimed
that you were the one who sent him,

25:59.490 --> 26:00.820
so I let down my guard.

26:01.210 --> 26:02.620
I was busy stopping a fight,

26:02.620 --> 26:04.660
and when I turned back, he was gone.

26:05.970 --> 26:07.580
He has certainly grown bolder.

26:07.580 --> 26:09.910
He even learned how to deceive people now.

26:09.940 --> 26:11.670
It seems I underestimated him.

26:11.940 --> 26:12.870
In your opinion,

26:13.010 --> 26:14.010
now that Li has been taken,

26:14.010 --> 26:15.140
where would they go?

26:15.290 --> 26:16.100
Do we need to send people

26:16.100 --> 26:17.490
to search for her in the city?

26:17.490 --> 26:18.690
He won't leave Linji.

26:19.140 --> 26:20.290
You don't need to worry about it.

26:20.290 --> 26:21.550
I'll find them myself.

26:23.940 --> 26:25.340
After Shanbao returned,

26:25.380 --> 26:26.640
-did she say...
-Miss.

26:31.490 --> 26:32.050
Miss.

26:32.380 --> 26:33.710
Here's a letter for you.

26:43.090 --> 26:43.890
What's wrong?

26:47.730 --> 26:49.260
It's just a private matter.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.640
I'll take my leave now.

27:03.180 --> 27:03.690
What?

27:04.860 --> 27:06.970
Is Shanbao still refusing to make the tea?

27:06.970 --> 27:07.930
That's not the issue.

27:07.930 --> 27:09.260
A servant just reported

27:09.730 --> 27:11.940
that Lady Yunxi went
to check the Tea King Tree

27:11.940 --> 27:13.600
and then left with the guards.

27:13.970 --> 27:14.900
What is she up to?

27:15.450 --> 27:16.700
I'm not sure, Miss.

27:17.340 --> 27:18.820
I only heard Lady Yunxi mentioned

27:18.820 --> 27:20.660
that a wall in her courtyard collapsed,

27:20.660 --> 27:22.330
so she took the nearby guards

27:22.690 --> 27:24.100
to clean up the debris.

27:25.580 --> 27:26.530
Fetch my clothes.

27:26.530 --> 27:27.770
I must see this for myself.

27:27.770 --> 27:28.370
Yes, Miss.

27:41.140 --> 27:42.250
Quickly!
Find people to extinguish the fire!

27:42.250 --> 27:43.900
Help! Somebody help! Hurry!

27:46.010 --> 27:46.470
This...

27:47.100 --> 27:47.760
Come! Come!

27:47.940 --> 27:49.050
Hurry! Hurry! Come on!

27:49.050 --> 27:49.450
Hurry.

27:50.010 --> 27:50.690
Hurry up!

27:50.970 --> 27:51.730
Put out the fire! Come on!

27:51.730 --> 27:52.490
We need more people!

27:52.490 --> 27:53.550
Quickly! Quickly!

27:53.690 --> 27:54.210
Hurry!

27:54.580 --> 27:56.690
-Water! Get the water!
-Put out the fire!

27:56.690 --> 27:57.180
Coming!

27:58.490 --> 27:59.020
Hurry up!

27:59.290 --> 27:59.820
Hurry up.

28:00.180 --> 28:01.180
Come on, quickly!

28:01.690 --> 28:03.290
Get some water from the well!

28:05.250 --> 28:06.420
Bring the water here!

28:06.420 --> 28:06.940
Coming!

28:07.690 --> 28:08.620
It's not enough!

28:09.180 --> 28:10.180
Get another bucket of water!

28:10.180 --> 28:10.970
Carry the water!

28:10.970 --> 28:11.970
-Hurry up!
-Coming!

28:11.970 --> 28:13.100
-Coming!
-Hurry up.

28:13.530 --> 28:14.730
-Coming!
-Hurry!

28:14.940 --> 28:15.400
Come on.

28:16.580 --> 28:17.110
Quickly!

28:17.530 --> 28:17.990
Coming!

28:19.420 --> 28:20.290
Get the water!

28:28.050 --> 28:28.580
Mr. Yan.

28:31.870 --> 28:32.380
Mr. Yan.

28:35.680 --> 28:36.540
There's a fire.

28:58.860 --> 28:59.740
Did you do this?

29:02.380 --> 29:03.790
What nonsense are you talking about?

29:03.790 --> 29:05.390
I had nothing to do with this!

29:07.010 --> 29:08.860
My courtyard wall collapsed for no reason,

29:08.860 --> 29:10.860
so I sent Cuiwei to seek assistance.

29:11.050 --> 29:12.180
After they arrived,

29:12.340 --> 29:12.820
Cuiwei and I

29:12.820 --> 29:14.420
watched them the whole time.

29:14.420 --> 29:16.550
It only took about 10 minutes in total.

29:16.580 --> 29:17.140
Yunshu,

29:17.970 --> 29:19.900
you are manager of the mansion now.

29:20.340 --> 29:21.180
Even if you want

29:21.180 --> 29:22.770
to evade responsibility
for your poor management,

29:22.770 --> 29:24.490
you should not slander me like that!

29:24.490 --> 29:25.380
If you hadn't

29:25.380 --> 29:26.640
moved the guards away,

29:27.010 --> 29:29.180
the Tea King Tree
would never have been ruined!

29:29.180 --> 29:30.820
When Shanbao was in charge,

29:31.420 --> 29:32.820
the Tea King Tree was never in danger,

29:32.820 --> 29:34.420
even without a single guard!

29:34.490 --> 29:37.080
Ultimately, this is a result
of your own incompetence.

29:37.080 --> 29:37.470
You!

29:41.630 --> 29:42.890
Are you satisfied now?

29:43.620 --> 29:44.580
Didn't you refuse to teach me

29:44.580 --> 29:45.690
the tea-making methods?

29:45.690 --> 29:46.620
Does this incident

29:46.620 --> 29:48.220
have anything to do with you?

29:56.380 --> 29:56.770
You!

29:57.250 --> 29:58.140
That slap

29:59.050 --> 30:00.450
was for your failure

30:00.940 --> 30:02.430
to prioritize what truly matters.

30:02.430 --> 30:05.030
In times of crisis,
you only think of yourself.

30:05.050 --> 30:06.920
You are so obsessed with our rivalry

30:06.920 --> 30:07.860
that you ignore

30:07.860 --> 30:08.820
the pack of hungry wolves outside

30:08.820 --> 30:10.490
waiting to devour the Rong family.

30:10.490 --> 30:11.900
The Tea King Tree is ruined,

30:11.900 --> 30:14.250
threatening the century-old foundation
of the Rong family.

30:14.250 --> 30:15.450
Now that disaster has struck,

30:15.450 --> 30:17.170
you don't think about how to fix it

30:17.170 --> 30:19.130
or investigate the security breach,

30:19.130 --> 30:21.660
yet you have the nerve
to vent your anger on me.

30:22.660 --> 30:23.450
All of this happened

30:23.450 --> 30:24.690
because Rong Yunxi

30:24.820 --> 30:26.140
moved the guards away.

30:26.290 --> 30:27.290
Why didn't you slap her instead?

30:27.290 --> 30:29.380
Your poor management was the root of it.

30:29.380 --> 30:31.530
There is a traitor
lurking in this mansion,

30:31.530 --> 30:32.930
yet you noticed nothing.

30:35.690 --> 30:37.290
You don't need to lecture me.

30:37.770 --> 30:39.700
You're living in the Rong Mansion.

30:39.700 --> 30:41.290
Now that the Tea King Tree
has been destroyed,

30:41.290 --> 30:42.900
and you are also responsible for it!

30:42.900 --> 30:43.770
Instead of standing here,

30:43.770 --> 30:45.630
calculating who is more to blame,

30:46.110 --> 30:46.940
you'd better start thinking

30:46.940 --> 30:49.070
about how to deal with what comes next.

30:49.360 --> 30:51.000
The imperial tribute is now destroyed;

30:51.000 --> 30:52.860
this is a matter of life and death.

30:55.660 --> 30:57.460
Grandmother is now severely ill

30:57.860 --> 30:59.490
and cannot handle any further bad news.

30:59.490 --> 31:01.150
If this reaches Chongxi Hall,

31:01.370 --> 31:02.700
you'll all be punished.

31:21.290 --> 31:23.290
If you want your daughter to be safe,

31:23.380 --> 31:24.140
at 7 PM,

31:24.580 --> 31:26.980
move the guards away
from the Tea King Tree.

31:29.940 --> 31:32.340
I thought he had finally
come to his senses.

31:32.480 --> 31:34.410
It turns out he was used once again,

31:34.620 --> 31:36.220
and dragged me down with him.

31:36.680 --> 31:39.210
What happened today
must not leave this room.

31:39.410 --> 31:40.410
Yes, Miss.

31:50.300 --> 31:52.630
The Empress Dowager's birthday tribute—

31:53.290 --> 31:55.690
how dare you treat it
with such negligence?

31:56.140 --> 31:58.210
Do you have any idea
what penalty you'll face?

31:58.210 --> 31:59.970
There was a traitor in the mansion.

31:59.970 --> 32:01.230
Rest assured, My Lord.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.240
I will investigate it thoroughly

32:02.240 --> 32:03.840
and give you an explanation.

32:03.860 --> 32:05.290
I don't care about that traitor.

32:05.290 --> 32:06.350
I want the tribute!

32:06.970 --> 32:08.280
The Tea King Tree has been destroyed,

32:08.280 --> 32:09.630
thereby offending the Empress Dowager.

32:09.630 --> 32:10.210
How many lives will the Rong family pay

32:10.210 --> 32:11.580
to atone for this?

32:11.900 --> 32:13.100
Rest assured, My Lord.

32:13.100 --> 32:14.290
The Rong Mansion has other

32:14.290 --> 32:15.620
century-old tea cakes.

32:16.100 --> 32:16.820
They're surely

32:16.820 --> 32:19.220
no inferior
to the Tea King Tree's harvest.

32:22.380 --> 32:23.640
Do you not understand?

32:24.380 --> 32:25.580
Her Majesty specifically requested

32:25.580 --> 32:27.440
tea leaves from the Tea King Tree.

32:27.460 --> 32:28.620
Her Majesty values

32:28.620 --> 32:30.330
the Tea King Tree's centuries-long history

32:30.330 --> 32:31.860
and its enduring blessing.

32:32.380 --> 32:32.900
How could

32:32.900 --> 32:34.830
any other tea possibly replace it?

32:35.630 --> 32:38.530
The Rong family has grown arrogant
under royal favor.

32:38.530 --> 32:39.660
You even treat
the Empress Dowager's birthday

32:39.660 --> 32:40.530
with contempt.

32:41.420 --> 32:43.290
You failed to deliver the tribute,

32:43.290 --> 32:45.350
yet you're trying to get away with it.

32:47.050 --> 32:47.530
Guards!

32:48.100 --> 32:48.730
-Yes.
-Yes.

32:48.730 --> 32:50.410
Take every member of the Rong family

32:50.410 --> 32:52.650
to the County Office for questioning.

32:53.100 --> 32:53.830
Yes, My Lord!

32:54.970 --> 32:55.530
Wait.

33:14.860 --> 33:15.920
Lady Rong Shanbao.

33:16.300 --> 33:18.960
The Rong family's Jade Seal
is an imperial gift,

33:19.250 --> 33:20.290
not a Death Exemption Token

33:20.290 --> 33:22.090
to protect you from your crimes.

33:22.230 --> 33:23.660
By flaunting it again and again,

33:23.660 --> 33:25.210
are you trying to use royal favor

33:25.210 --> 33:27.580
to stand above the law in Linji?

33:28.050 --> 33:29.710
Lord Luo, you misunderstand.

33:30.180 --> 33:31.040
This Jade Seal—

33:31.680 --> 33:34.080
I want to entrust it to you
for safekeeping.

33:34.620 --> 33:35.950
What do you mean by that?

33:36.530 --> 33:37.770
The fact that the Tea King Tree got burned

33:37.770 --> 33:39.230
was due to our negligence.

33:39.530 --> 33:42.060
This Jade Seal is
the Rong family's heirloom.

33:42.520 --> 33:44.320
I'd like to use it as a guarantee.

33:44.380 --> 33:45.380
Within five days,

33:45.670 --> 33:46.290
I will surely find a tribute

33:46.290 --> 33:48.150
worthy of the Tea King Tree's tea.

33:53.850 --> 33:56.840
There's still time
before the Empress Dowager's birthday.

33:56.840 --> 33:58.900
Why not wait five more days, Lord Luo?

34:00.200 --> 34:01.400
I believe Her Majesty

34:01.580 --> 34:03.210
would rather see the tribute presented

34:03.210 --> 34:04.670
than see people punished.

34:06.180 --> 34:09.340
Lord Lu, you are the magistrate of Linji.

34:10.210 --> 34:12.489
You shouldn't get too close to merchants,

34:12.489 --> 34:14.620
or you may invite unnecessary gossip.

34:14.690 --> 34:16.260
Lord Luo, you misunderstand.

34:16.260 --> 34:16.780
Today,

34:17.449 --> 34:18.050
I'm not here

34:18.050 --> 34:19.510
in my capacity as Prefect.

34:21.300 --> 34:22.900
Then what is your role?

34:23.750 --> 34:25.679
As an admirer of Lady Rong Shanbao.

34:32.389 --> 34:33.120
Lord Luo.

34:38.030 --> 34:39.030
What do you think?

34:49.730 --> 34:52.130
I'll take this Jade Seal.

34:53.340 --> 34:54.670
I hope Lady Rong Shanbao

34:55.130 --> 34:56.530
will not disappoint me.

34:58.170 --> 34:59.100
You have my word.

35:08.900 --> 35:11.210
What kind of birthday tribute
are you going to prepare?

35:11.210 --> 35:12.810
That is none of your concern.

35:13.380 --> 35:14.650
For the time being,

35:15.460 --> 35:16.740
you should stay in the mansion

35:16.740 --> 35:18.670
and reflect upon what you've done.

35:27.860 --> 35:29.260
What kind of birthday tribute do you think

35:29.260 --> 35:31.320
Rong Shanbao will offer Her Majesty?

35:33.050 --> 35:34.850
No matter what she comes up with,

35:35.130 --> 35:37.340
the Rong family's Tea King Tree
has already been destroyed.

35:37.340 --> 35:38.300
After this,

35:39.610 --> 35:41.650
the Rong family will be severely weakened

35:41.650 --> 35:42.980
and will never recover.

35:43.180 --> 35:44.240
That's not enough.

35:45.170 --> 35:46.430
We have to take her life

35:47.050 --> 35:48.450
while she's vulnerable.

35:55.970 --> 35:57.230
Rest assured, My Lord.

35:57.740 --> 36:00.010
I already have people watch Rong Shanbao.

36:00.010 --> 36:00.970
No matter what kind of birthday tribute

36:00.970 --> 36:02.370
she's planning to offer,

36:03.050 --> 36:04.380
I won't let her succeed.

36:08.770 --> 36:12.370
No wonder they say, "One should
never underestimate a scholar."

36:12.490 --> 36:13.220
You truly are

36:13.380 --> 36:15.170
a lucky star sent by God.

36:17.300 --> 36:18.820
Thank you for your kind words, My Lord.

36:18.820 --> 36:21.420
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

36:21.970 --> 36:22.610
What is it?

36:24.450 --> 36:26.220
Now that the Rong family
is under house arrest,

36:26.220 --> 36:28.820
I'd like you to give me control
over the guards.

36:30.450 --> 36:33.660
Are you concerned
that Lady Rong Yunshu may be mistreated?

36:33.660 --> 36:34.090
No.

36:35.610 --> 36:37.380
She used to trample upon me.

36:37.940 --> 36:38.490
Now,

36:39.650 --> 36:40.450
I want her

36:40.450 --> 36:42.310
to get a taste of her own medicine.

36:44.420 --> 36:46.020
You've done a great service.

36:46.110 --> 36:47.640
This is a small thing to ask.

36:47.900 --> 36:49.160
Just consider it done.

37:01.260 --> 37:02.060
Lady Shanbao.

37:05.530 --> 37:06.330
Lady Shanbao.

37:06.930 --> 37:07.860
Are you leaving?

37:08.300 --> 37:09.530
The Rong family is in trouble.

37:09.530 --> 37:10.860
You're not a member of the Rong family.

37:10.860 --> 37:12.790
You may pack your things and leave.

37:12.950 --> 37:15.280
Are you going to look for another tribute?

37:16.010 --> 37:17.260
I'm just buying time.

37:17.970 --> 37:18.900
I have to find a way

37:18.900 --> 37:20.230
to save the Rong family.

37:20.550 --> 37:21.220
Is there anything

37:21.220 --> 37:22.080
I can do to help?

37:23.380 --> 37:25.260
All my past suitors sought marriage

37:25.260 --> 37:27.320
only because my name is Rong Shanbao.

37:27.420 --> 37:28.820
If the Rong family falls,

37:29.340 --> 37:31.600
would you still stay at the Rong Mansion?

37:33.850 --> 37:35.810
I see. I have my answer.

37:52.110 --> 37:53.570
What did you two talk about?

37:53.570 --> 37:55.100
It's none of your business.

38:24.320 --> 38:26.550
It... it's you.

38:29.060 --> 38:30.990
I thought the first thing you'd say

38:31.110 --> 38:32.050
when we met again

38:32.050 --> 38:34.110
would be whether I am human or a ghost.

38:35.220 --> 38:37.250
You were the one
who burned the Tea King Tree?

38:37.250 --> 38:38.470
Shouldn't you be asking me

38:38.470 --> 38:39.700
how I survived?

38:40.460 --> 38:42.320
Why did you burn the Tea King Tree?

38:42.890 --> 38:44.950
You really don't care if I live or die.

38:53.260 --> 38:54.380
Why that look?

38:55.130 --> 38:57.190
Why don't you cry, show weakness,

38:57.450 --> 38:59.720
or at least try to explain
that you didn't mean it?

38:59.720 --> 39:00.410
In the past,

39:01.560 --> 39:03.620
didn't you play that part quite well?

39:03.780 --> 39:04.910
If you want revenge,

39:05.550 --> 39:07.380
don't drag the whole Rong Mansion into it.

39:07.380 --> 39:08.170
The thing you're most proud of

39:08.170 --> 39:10.030
is the Rong family name, isn't it?

39:10.430 --> 39:11.940
If I destroy the Rong family,

39:11.940 --> 39:13.810
will you still be so high and mighty,

39:13.810 --> 39:15.500
looking down on everyone else?

39:15.500 --> 39:16.360
Bai Yingsheng.

39:17.130 --> 39:18.860
You're not this kind of person.

39:18.920 --> 39:20.780
You don't know me at all.

39:24.570 --> 39:25.430
Bai Yingsheng.

39:25.820 --> 39:27.550
Don't go against Rong Shanbao.

39:27.650 --> 39:28.980
You're no match for her.

39:46.490 --> 39:47.050
This is

39:47.050 --> 39:48.260
what you asked me to get earlier.

39:48.260 --> 39:49.860
The inventory list
of the Wei family's seized assets.

39:49.860 --> 39:50.660
It's all here.

39:58.860 --> 39:59.890
This scribe here

40:00.570 --> 40:02.380
must've been with the County Office
for a long time, right?

40:02.380 --> 40:03.440
That's Scribe Liu.

40:03.970 --> 40:04.490
He has served in the office

40:04.490 --> 40:05.490
for 30 or 40 years.

40:13.050 --> 40:14.980
Shouldn't you be worried
about the birthday tribute?

40:14.980 --> 40:16.910
How do you still have time for this?

40:25.780 --> 40:27.510
Last night at the Rong Mansion,

40:27.820 --> 40:28.380
someone actually

40:28.380 --> 40:29.700
managed to burn down

40:29.700 --> 40:31.220
the Tea King Tree right under your nose.

40:31.220 --> 40:33.020
My courtyard was being watched.

40:33.450 --> 40:34.850
How could I possibly know

40:35.020 --> 40:36.860
everything happening in the mansion?

40:36.860 --> 40:37.610
But I've always felt

40:37.610 --> 40:39.020
that you're extraordinary—

40:39.020 --> 40:40.220
capable of anything.

40:41.890 --> 40:43.150
I'm not sure I can do it.

40:44.220 --> 40:44.820
What?

40:48.090 --> 40:48.820
I said,

40:49.970 --> 40:51.970
about the
Empress Dowager's birthday tribute,

40:51.970 --> 40:53.500
I'm not sure I can handle it.

41:00.390 --> 41:01.100
So what?

41:01.970 --> 41:03.290
Through thick and thin,

41:03.290 --> 41:04.890
I'll be right there with you.

41:07.420 --> 41:08.750
What about your career?

41:09.130 --> 41:11.000
I've always been alone in this world.

41:11.000 --> 41:11.960
Wherever you are

41:12.740 --> 41:13.790
is where I belong.

41:27.860 --> 41:28.530
Have you heard of

41:28.530 --> 41:29.790
"Chin Hsiu Wan Hua Ku?"

41:33.860 --> 41:34.530
What is it?

41:34.970 --> 41:37.300
It's a rare Song Dynasty book collection.

41:37.860 --> 41:38.920
For any book lover,

41:39.200 --> 41:41.930
a single glimpse
would make one's life complete.

41:42.170 --> 41:43.570
If I remember correctly,

41:44.130 --> 41:46.660
the Empress Dowager
loves collecting books.

41:47.450 --> 41:48.710
You're planning to...

41:48.740 --> 41:49.340
Exactly.

41:50.300 --> 41:52.630
Her Majesty doesn't truly care about tea.

41:52.990 --> 41:54.170
She's just curious about the Tea King Tree

41:54.170 --> 41:55.920
because of its century-old reputation.

41:55.920 --> 41:57.240
If I cater to her true interests

41:57.240 --> 41:59.510
and replace the tea
with something she loves,

41:59.510 --> 42:01.310
I hope it will appease her anger,

42:01.860 --> 42:03.700
and give the Rong family
a chance to survive.

42:03.700 --> 42:04.570
So where is

42:05.300 --> 42:06.650
this rare book collection now?

42:06.650 --> 42:08.050
When Mrs. Yang was alive,

42:08.170 --> 42:09.970
she happened to mention it once.

42:10.060 --> 42:11.500
Wei Kejian had this book

42:11.740 --> 42:13.800
collected in the Wei family library.

42:15.490 --> 42:16.610
No wonder you wanted to see

42:16.610 --> 42:18.820
the inventory list
of the Wei family's seized assets.

42:18.820 --> 42:20.820
While reviewing the files earlier,

42:21.300 --> 42:23.570
I learned
that the year Wei Kejian was imprisoned,

42:23.570 --> 42:24.610
the Wei family servants

42:24.610 --> 42:26.490
fled with stolen valuables

42:26.920 --> 42:29.250
and accidentally set the library on fire.

42:29.860 --> 42:32.570
Could this book have been burned?

42:33.260 --> 42:35.100
This book is incredibly valuable.

42:35.100 --> 42:37.700
The Wei family servants
surely knew its value.

42:37.740 --> 42:39.470
If they were looting the place,

42:39.670 --> 42:41.780
this book would've been
their first target.

42:41.780 --> 42:42.380
Wait.

42:44.090 --> 42:46.940
You asked for the inventory list

42:46.940 --> 42:48.700
before the Tea King Tree was burned.

42:48.700 --> 42:50.220
Did you already anticipate

42:50.220 --> 42:52.260
that something
would happen to the tribute?

42:52.260 --> 42:52.820
No.

42:54.000 --> 42:55.450
I asked for the list earlier

42:55.450 --> 42:55.910
to find the truth

42:55.910 --> 42:57.370
behind Mrs. Yang's death.

42:57.950 --> 42:58.830
I was hoping

42:59.220 --> 43:01.020
if I could find any clues from it.

43:01.520 --> 43:03.650
Now it turns to be a lucky coincidence.

43:07.140 --> 43:08.140
Time is precious.

43:08.610 --> 43:09.580
I need to post notices

43:09.580 --> 43:11.470
and offer a large reward for this book.

43:11.470 --> 43:12.800
As for Mrs. Yang's case,

43:12.880 --> 43:14.850
I'll need your help to investigate it.

43:14.850 --> 43:17.780
She would never
have taken her own life for no reason.

43:19.700 --> 43:20.430
Don't worry.

43:21.420 --> 43:22.750
Justice will be served.

43:23.090 --> 43:26.090
Those who do evil deeds
will eventually pay the price.

46:11.580 --> 46:14.030
[Tea Refreshments]

46:14.900 --> 46:16.430
Eat slowly, take your time.

46:16.650 --> 46:18.010
China's tea refreshment culture

46:18.010 --> 46:20.010
can be traced back
to the Tang Dynasty and Song Dynasty.

46:20.010 --> 46:21.740
During the Tang Dynasty,
the decoction method was popular.

46:21.740 --> 46:24.110
Tea refreshments were mostly used
to cleanse the palate,

46:24.110 --> 46:26.100
such as sesame cakes and Bo-tuo noodles,

46:26.100 --> 46:27.680
as well as preserved dates
and dried lychees.

46:27.680 --> 46:29.000
These helped balance the tea's bitterness.

46:29.000 --> 46:31.030
By the Song Dynasty,
the whisking method became trendy.

46:31.030 --> 46:33.380
Tea refreshments
became more delicate and elegant,

46:33.380 --> 46:35.860
like fried butter shells and spring rolls.

46:35.860 --> 46:37.050
They offer a rich variety of textures.

46:37.050 --> 46:38.550
During the Ming Dynasty and Song Dynasty,

46:38.550 --> 46:40.140
tea refreshments became more mature.

46:40.140 --> 46:42.090
During the Ming dynasty, a Tea Bureau
was established for tea banquets,

46:42.090 --> 46:43.590
serving various cakes and pastries,

46:43.590 --> 46:45.530
such as osmanthus cake
and gorgon nut cake.

46:45.530 --> 46:46.380
It also served nuts,

46:46.380 --> 46:48.650
like fried ginkgo nuts
and salted pine nuts.

46:48.650 --> 46:49.820
Suzhou-style tea snacks,

46:49.820 --> 46:51.860
such as sesame biscuits
and rose crisps,

46:51.860 --> 46:53.200
were paired with Biluochun tea.

46:53.200 --> 46:54.440
Northern teahouses served

46:54.440 --> 46:55.510
Manchu-Han pastries,

46:55.510 --> 46:58.170
like sachima, tuckahoe pie,
and pea flour cake.

46:58.260 --> 46:59.690
The iconic Qing imperial tea snacks,

46:59.690 --> 47:00.420
known as the "Jing Ba Jian,"

47:00.420 --> 47:01.780
were paired with jasmine tea.

47:01.780 --> 47:03.820
Chaozhou lard sugar pastries

47:03.980 --> 47:05.560
were paired with Fenghuang Dancong tea.

47:05.560 --> 47:06.220
What do you think?

47:06.220 --> 47:07.600
Out of all these tea refreshments,

47:07.600 --> 47:08.810
is there anything you like?
